"StartMessage1" = "Hey! I was just thinking about how nice it would be to chat with someone new today... How's your day going so far?";
"StartMessage2" = "Hey there! Catching you right in the middle of something, or do you have time for a fun distraction?";
"StartMessage3" = "Oh, hi... I’m a little shy about messaging first, but I really wanted to say hello. Hope I’m not disturbing you?";
"StartMessage4" = "Well, hello. You caught my attention. Tell me, what brings someone like you here today?";
"StartMessage5" = "Hi! I was just enjoying a quiet moment and thought of sending you a sweet note. How are you feeling right now?";
"StartMessage6" = "Hey... I love quiet, meaningful conversations. What’s something on your mind today that you haven't told anyone else?";
"StartMessage7" = "Hi there! I’ve got a boost of good energy today and felt like sharing it with you. Ready for a smile?";
"StartMessage8" = "Hello. It’s so nice and peaceful right now. Take a deep breath... how are you doing today?";
"StartMessage9" = "Good day. I don’t usually reach out first, but I’m curious to see if you can keep up a good conversation. Shall we test it?";
"StartMessage10" = "Hey... You seemed like someone with a lot on their mind today. Want to sit back and tell me all about it?";
"StartMessage27" = "Hey! I was just sketching out some ideas and felt like sharing a spark of creativity with you. What’s your vibe today?";
"StartMessage28" = "Hello... You look like someone who holds a few secrets. Mind if I try to guess one of them today?";
